  "releaseNotes": "v1.6.0 - Universal AOT Validation Support 🚀\n    - Universal Library Support: Sannr now works out-of-the-box in Class Libraries without any ASP.NET Core dependencies.\n    - Conditional OpenAPI Synergy: Source generator automatically detects your environment and only emits OpenAPI registration code when Swashbuckle/AspNetCore is present.\n    - Swashbuckle v10 Safety: New SANN005 analyzer warns if your SannrOpenApiVersion configuration doesn't match your project references.\n    - Improved SANN004 Diagnostics: More precise error reporting for missing 'partial' keywords.\n    - Dev Experience: Enabled EmitCompilerGeneratedFiles with automatic item exclusion for better debugging.",
